tight.

343
00:09:09,230 --> 00:09:10,590
That's the squeeze.

344
00:09:10,650 --> 00:09:11,300
Four.

345
00:09:11,590 --> 00:09:13,540
Red and near-infrared
light have been

346
00:09:13,540 --> 00:09:15,840
